    "b0003-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "08a026f364fe72f8b99b6db4de2a46e4ee11d4df5b17bf78ff225aeee1ce0599",
      "targetHash": "92b6befeb255a569065995a63ceff122a6a2f28c83d399eaf20f8d63f3e5ed7b",
      "machineHash": "92b6befeb255a569065995a63ceff122a6a2f28c83d399eaf20f8d63f3e5ed7b",
      "machineText": "从点击到弹出窗口内容可见大约需要 4 到 8 秒。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Opening a popup window takes around 4 to 8 seconds from click to visible content.",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0004-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "bdd91f74f88af18a0c1ea11944994df216f5140bdf137b2655aa355a4a1c4101",
      "targetHash": "b66509270881136a4027897966765c5d9c0dbe519c39fd938c50ad7b65eafdf1",
      "machineHash": "b66509270881136a4027897966765c5d9c0dbe519c39fd938c50ad7b65eafdf1",
      "machineText": "关闭窗口会使父窗口阻塞大约 2 秒。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Closing a window blocks the parent window for around 2 seconds.",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0005-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "d528a1d5773854641980b0aef423c93931f6338184cfc55d29b58214736e577b",
      "targetHash": "af5ce1371e4f3e692b33de5e37de29074a430b02aaf46b38817997d3b33d778c",
      "machineHash": "af5ce1371e4f3e692b33de5e37de29074a430b02aaf46b38817997d3b33d778c",
      "machineText": "重新连接后，卡顿状态仍会持续，只有重启主机才能消除。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "The slow state persists across reconnects and only clears after the host machine is rebooted.",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0006-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "06e4acf0308131114e108506277c8f7217395c3e17a3ec2dff01d92c7dc3baef",
      "targetHash": "0e937279554e0ed7a9a3b52c306cb1d9b7b4b6cb07ed4136c9e693350965720d",
      "machineHash": "0e937279554e0ed7a9a3b52c306cb1d9b7b4b6cb07ed4136c9e693350965720d",
      "machineText": "此问题最常见于 iOS 上的 Microsoft Remote Desktop 客户端，该客户端会在会话进行过程中配置针对 Retina 优化的虚拟显示器。任何在会话中途引入具有不同 DPI 上下文的显示器的 RDP 客户端，都可能触发相同的行为。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "This is most often seen with the Microsoft Remote Desktop client on iOS, which provisions a Retina-o…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0007-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "8d892c3c9826b727d4d2be362514e8b2a3cc70ef065ff4d6966df2bc12ca4cfe",
      "targetHash": "f029d9cb4a7614ef86725b1fafa5e78adb6eaff8efc5967ee952ac73cb39bd62",
      "machineHash": "f029d9cb4a7614ef86725b1fafa5e78adb6eaff8efc5967ee952ac73cb39bd62",
      "machineText": "原因",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Why it happens",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0008-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "67624803118f6b099746a66d2efc4a1f46e762fd3a0da054a03e27e1b3b5084f",
      "targetHash": "60f924d532eab48381e4b4a1eb22dccaee60ccb46c4d5a904e6ce86ad1269b8c",
      "machineHash": "60f924d532eab48381e4b4a1eb22dccaee60ccb46c4d5a904e6ce86ad1269b8c",
      "machineText": "默认情况下，WebView2 使用窗口托管模式，其合成器表面位于子窗口中。当 RDP 客户端引入 DPI 上下文与会话不同的显示器时，每次 WebView2 控制器调用（`PutIsVisible`、`MoveFocus`、首次绘制和表面释放）都会强制执行同步的 DirectComposition 重新封送。每次重新封送都会阻塞 UI 线程大约 2 秒，因此在大量使用弹出窗口的应用中，卡顿会不断叠加。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "By default, WebView2 uses windowed hosting, where its compositor surface lives in a child window. Wh…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0009-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "37fe272ea2e1484e7161b493827e9fb21e6a97fcf3d25096cbe8623596f2f7de",
      "targetHash": "81ddc62504634fa5ef5599121a22a3b01b9457c29b1ecefbcd062503329338c2",
      "machineHash": "81ddc62504634fa5ef5599121a22a3b01b9457c29b1ecefbcd062503329338c2",
      "machineText": "同一台计算机上的原生 Win32 + WebView2 应用不受影响，因为它使用可视化托管。这表明问题的原因是托管模式，而不是 WebView2 或 Windows 合成器的普遍问题。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "A native Win32 plus WebView2 application on the same machine is unaffected, because it relies on vis…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0010-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "22927695994eab589c7601a6b15df4d9dc67c5aceb9a74cdb965444b9b8362a6",
      "targetHash": "27aa2247752d5aa0ae8035e95cc494575a2116e41af3860bc6a55b4c16e97d1f",
      "machineHash": "27aa2247752d5aa0ae8035e95cc494575a2116e41af3860bc6a55b4c16e97d1f",
      "machineText": "解决方案",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Solution",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0011-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "b1ce0771547b1109b1294959f92a86d5dbefb5394e3efcfb49abc303fc199dab",
      "targetHash": "1d6978b300bd9cef7d2327f5326cd2634c10df27106286e4354cbad9bc8efdbf",
      "machineHash": "1d6978b300bd9cef7d2327f5326cd2634c10df27106286e4354cbad9bc8efdbf",
      "machineText": "在 Windows 选项中设置 `UseVisualHosting`，以启用可视化托管。使用可视化托管时，WebView2 的合成器表面通过主机拥有的 DirectComposition 可视化对象进行管理，因此 DPI 上下文变化不再触发同步重新封送。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Enable visual hosting by setting `UseVisualHosting` in your Windows options. With visual hosting, We…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0012-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "0bd1231730bc139dd76f2ed8b6dd9d56cc4d39706b0106e0f79482d2e038b109",
      "targetHash": "8b7b9a981a36d04757817ebabf65477468e4c728280daadfe967dffb7dc1db09",
      "machineHash": "8b7b9a981a36d04757817ebabf65477468e4c728280daadfe967dffb7dc1db09",
      "machineText": "启用后，弹出窗口会在正常的导航时间内打开（约为 150 到 500 毫秒），关闭窗口也不再阻塞父窗口。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "After enabling it, popups open within normal navigation time (roughly 150 to 500 ms) and closing a w…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0013-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "1095da597effe3f8682fc0cc28877f584d5f150ee2c7683b436966b82db82087",
      "targetHash": "e5088d83262387814a11344dafe9ae2e186b69f9e43d426a9a9aca4d6b6efb29",
      "machineHash": "e5088d83262387814a11344dafe9ae2e186b69f9e43d426a9a9aca4d6b6efb29",
      "machineText": "必须在 `app.Run()` 之前设置 `UseVisualHosting`。Wails 会在应用启动期间读取此选项，并在初始化 WebView2 环境之前，将 `COREWEBVIEW2_FORCED_HOSTING_MODE` 环境变量设置为 `COREWEBVIEW2_HOSTING_MODE_WINDOW_TO_VISUAL`。之后再设置不会生效。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "`UseVisualHosting` must be set before `app.Run()`. Wails reads it during application startup and set…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0014-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "6175ac3099231cbf4b322158c3a55f5c5e89aee4c8c43a4737a904aabd7ea1d4",
      "targetHash": "208e98c120d144d1e3d3143bb2d8d4c7503b460748b9b0cf1f57fbd1ec4d6bdb",
      "machineHash": "208e98c120d144d1e3d3143bb2d8d4c7503b460748b9b0cf1f57fbd1ec4d6bdb",
      "machineText": "该选项默认为 `false`，因此窗口托管模式仍是默认模式。除非现有应用主动启用此选项，否则其行为不会发生变化。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "The option defaults to `false`, so windowed hosting remains the default. Existing apps see no change…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0015-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "799b9a9514031be2ec15a8792bda8b4c29a1b5811a428160c53813046a5f0275",
      "targetHash": "c422afff1379464ded394e6499b10d4d72ff69dda9f514844ecd51a16f3e65ee",
      "machineHash": "c422afff1379464ded394e6499b10d4d72ff69dda9f514844ecd51a16f3e65ee",
      "machineText": "何时启用",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "When to enable it",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
    "b0016-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "0c3ce80389ffa7b2ee0008b1385065df4d3e50ab71cdf8f6cbadc98b739f63ef",
      "targetHash": "be30c044ba50dd347e19ec35c4d70db32512aa2c4cb2ac6ced4d54d5e69a8855",
      "machineHash": "be30c044ba50dd347e19ec35c4d70db32512aa2c4cb2ac6ced4d54d5e69a8855",
      "machineText": "如果你的应用经常通过 RDP 使用，尤其是通过 iOS 上的 Microsoft Remote Desktop 客户端使用，并且在打开或关闭窗口时出现持续数秒的卡顿，请设置 `UseVisualHosting: true`。如果你的应用不通过 RDP 运行，则无需使用此选项，可以保留默认设置。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Set `UseVisualHosting: true` if your app is regularly used over RDP, especially the Microsoft Remote…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:51Z"
    },
